hboard photos we were looking at. Is there anything in my to-do list about it too? I have a feeling I promised someone something.\", \"Totally different thing, and I keep forgetting it: the boat shed PIN is 20134, can you keep that in the locker so I've got it somewhere safe?\"], [\"can u find the shots on bocce\", \"what about capoeira\", \"and washboard?\", \"wait quick one, pics with Wulan Faimere in them?\", \"ok back to the washboard ones, anything on my to-do list about it too\", \"oh and the boat shed PIN is 20134, pls stick it in the locker\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0051\", \"v\": [[\"who's in the Norhaven house share group\", \"diff thing, which tasks dont have a due date\", \"move the second one to monday pls\", \"what else is on during the Genholm trip\", \"hang on, which places have i got exactly one photo from\", \"ok back to genholm, for the trip one whos else gonna be there\"], [\"Norhaven house share members?\", \"tasks with no due date?\", \"second one to monday\", \"anything else during Genholm?\", \"wait—places with only one photo?\", \"back to Genholm—who's on the trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0052\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to remember who's who before a reunion next month, so could you pull up Castie Loani for me?\", \"Right, that jogs my memory. And Adebayo Canby, what've you got on them?\", \"Brilliant, and one last one while I'm going through the list: Jonas Borkowski?\"], [\"pull up Castie Loani\", \"and Adebayo Canby?\", \"and Jonas Borkowski?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0053\", \"v\": [[\"put Novo Tyres in Dalat trip\", \"post task to friday, Lakshmi one to next monday\"], [\"Could you please put Novo Tyres in the Dalat trip group?\", \"Thank you. Separately, would you mind moving the post task to friday and the Lakshmi one to next monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I finally got hold of Selim about that thing that's been bugging me, so I phoned Selim today, could you log that call for me?\", \"Oh sorry, I've got two of them, don't I. It's the plumber, that's who I meant.\"], [\"Could you please log that I phoned Selim today?\", \"Apologies for the confusion, I meant the plumber.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0057\", \"v\": [[\"phoned Selim the plumber today, can u log it\"], [\"Could you please log that I phoned Selim, the plumber, today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0058\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to reconcile what everyone owes from the holiday, so which group did the dalat top-up end up going into?\", \"Ok, and could you show me the other expenses in that group so I can see the whole picture?\", \"Hmm, there was a subscription in there somewhere I think, what did that come to?\", \"Actually, you know what, forget it, I'll sort that out another time.\", \"Different thing, before I lose the thought: remind me to email Minseo about the trumpet saturday, I keep putting it off.\", \"Oh and going back to that list, the car one, which group is that in? I can't remember who we split it with.\"], [\"what group did the dalat top-up go in\", \"whats the other expenses in there\", \"what did the subscription come to\", \"eh forget it\", \"oh remind me to email Minseo about the trumpet saturday\", \"the car one, which group's it in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0060\", \"v\": [[\"bocce task and event to tomorrow\", \"25 reais petrol, Norhaven house share, I paid\", \"note: books to read this summer\", \"first one's expenses?\", \"sixteen reais taxi, flint fund, I paid\"], [\"move both bocce things to tomorrow, the task and the calendar one\", \"add 25 reais for petrol to Norhaven house share, i paid\", \"jot a note that says books to read this summer\", \"can u show the expenses for the first one\", \"log sixteen reais of taxi in flint fund pls, paid by me\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0061\", \"v\": [[\"Something's come up this afternoon and I won't make it, so is there any way the quartzite sale appointment could go to tomorrow instead?\", \"Oh no, hang on, that was the wrong one. I meant the daffodil repair one, sorry, I got my wires crossed.\"], [\"umm can the quartzite sale thing, the appointment, go to tomorrow instead?\", \"oh wait no no, wrong one, I meant the uh… the daffodil repair one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0001\", \"v\": [[\"open tasks?\"], [\"which tasks r still open\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0003\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please make the teacher appointment an hour earlier?\", \"Thank you. Could you also mark the jamjar to-do as complete, please?\", \"One more thing: do I have any photos of Grolou Montague?\"], [\"The school just emailed about timings, so would you move the teacher one to an hour earlier?\", \"And while I'm ticking things off, I finally did the jamjar one, so mark that to-do as done.\", \"Oh, and I'm making a card for a friend's birthday, do I have any photos of Grolou Montague?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0004\", \"v\": [[\"ferry task to sunday\", \"anything today?\"], [\"Could you please push the ferry task to sunday?\", \"Thanks. Is anything happening today, by any chance?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0005\", \"v\": [[\"still to do next week?\", \"second one to friday\"], [\"ok so what've I… what do I still have to get done next week?\", \"umm can you move the second one to friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0006\", \"v\": [[\"uh, can you find my files about grapefruit?\", \"ok and what about pizaum?\", \"oh and um, do I have any notes about blackbird?\"], [\"got any files about grapefruit\", \"what about pizaum\", \"also any notes about blackbird?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0007\", \"v\": [[\"how many notes in the Dulcimer notebook\", \"settle up what i owe Grolou Montague pls\", \"how many notes do i have in Dulcimer, the notebook\"], [\"notes in Dulcimer notebook?\", \"settle up with Grolou Montague\", \"Dulcimer notebook note count?\"]]}","ttft_ms":5642,"type":"result","duration_ms":25251,"uuid":"d5db4d30-590b-48a0-8e29-ee7bf3955ca2","ttft_stream_ms":1517,"time_to_request_ms":146,"first_content_frame_ms":1518,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22334524,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278885074.